# Dimensions by name (an extension): the bottom side's dimension named
# width in its editor, as the file shows, and the right side's reads
# it as width/2. Renamed to w in its editor, the right side's expression
# follows; taking the name away while it is used is refused with a
# message naming the user.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
move 290 330
down L 290 330
up L 290 330
key d
key esc
move 380 265
down L 380 265
up L 380 265
key d
key esc
