down L 290 370
up L 290 370
down L 290 370
dbl L 290 370
up L 290 370
edit width = 40
move 430 270
down L 430 270
up L 430 270
down L 430 270
dbl L 430 270
up L 430 270
edit width/2
save
move 290 370
down L 290 370
dbl L 290 370
up L 290 370
edit w = 40
